	(text "J1-J3 and J2-J4 are the two halves of the differential channel, measured as a 4-port in the order TX+, TX-, RX+, RX-." (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "974c740c-4c84-4b02-adec-f71aca181757"))
	(text "J5-J6 is the thru line, measured to remove the connector and launch from the 12 in results." (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "a895ceb7-8698-46c2-8ca4-cf4f53823f70"))
	(text "Every connector shield ties to the board ground pour and stitching vias." (at 25.4 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "673ee706-4986-48c1-a37d-78d7509f7946"))
